                            // ... the barrel showing through the case is only ~6.9mm ...
                            // what actually has to fit through the hole is the FIELD OF
                            // VIEW CONE, not the glass.
                            // The lens sits at z = BM_BASE_T + BM_STANDOFF = 15 and the
