   - **`stand_support(yc)` (~line 964) — first line CHANGED:**
     ```scad
     module stand_support(yc) {
         tower_foot([0, yc + SUPP_FOOT_DY, SUPP_W, SUPP_FOOT_L, SUPP_FOOT_X, 0]);
         translate([0, yc + SAD_T / 2, 0])
